 "posts": [
  "POWER RESTORATION UPDATE\nAffected Areas: Portion of PF1 - Hacienda Kinilatan, Brgy. Guimbalaon, Silay City.\nRestored at 11:03 AM\nOur dedicated team has successfully restored power to the affected areas.\nWe sincerely thank our valued consumers for your patience and continued support throughout the restoration process.\nIf you are still experiencing a power outage, kindly send us your account details and contact number so we can assist you as soon as possible.\nThank you for your patience and understanding.\nSERVICE BEYOND POWER\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService",
  "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: SEPTEMBER 25, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa September 25, 2026 (Friday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: September 25, 2026 (Friday)\nReason: Relocation of one 10kVa common Distribution Transformer to designated load center.\nTime & Affected Areas:\n10:00AM to 3:00PM\nPortion of PF1 - Hacienda Kinilatan, Brgy. Guimbalaon, Silay City.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService"
 ],
